作り、4か月使った記録</title><link>https://zenn.dev/hiroxasobiba/articles/secondbrain-ai-memory-layers</link><guid isPermaLink="false">urn:sha256:607b82bfea4f631d50cd0ea215e095084528e16c2ab2f603d2c4351d653d480c</guid><category>ZENN</category><chr2:sourceName>Zenn</chr2:sourceName><chr2:firstObservedAtJST>2026-11-22T23:40:00.547645+09:00</chr2:firstObservedAtJST><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:08:59 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>AIに実装を任せても、理解と判断は手放さない：基準・証拠・説明をGoのAPIで試した記録</title><link>https://zenn.dev/kinuuu/articles/ai-coding-criteria-evidence-explanation</link><guid isPermaLink="false">urn:sha256:7670aa21eddc74c923f6883a0c676bc56e17bf34830ded6276ff7044323cde00</guid><category>ZENN</category><chr2:sourceName>Zenn</chr2:sourceName><chr2:firstObservedAtJST>2026-11-22T23:40:00.547645+09:00</chr2:firstObservedAtJST><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:21:37 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>全二重音声対話モデルHaru-4BをCPUとGPUで動かしたら、GPUでは1フレーム133msを切ったが返事は毎回違った</title><link>https://zenn.dev/matsushima_a/articles/day-054-haru4b-full-duplex-cpu-vs-gpu</link><guid isPermaLink="false">urn:sha256:7454f31a7285a2a8e43dfb1bb6118266093bcc5e4f76bc79af989c065049313b</guid><category>ZENN</category><chr2:sourceName>Zenn</chr2:sourceName><chr2:firstObservedAtJST>2026-11-22T23:40:00.547645+09:00</chr2:firstObservedAtJST><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:37:57 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>第三者のAgent Skillを30本入れる前の点検：4本を見送り、内容を直した</title><link>https://zenn.dev/nishi0001/articles/agent-skills-vetting-30-before-install</link><guid isPermaLink="false">urn:sha256:7e522de2e4ebb99104c99d52db5e47668b86fc62d4ae7fd9a9f244472de13a5f</guid><category>ZENN</category><chr2:sourceName>Zenn</chr2:sourceName><chr2:firstObservedAtJST>2026-11-22T23:40:00.547645+09:00</chr2:firstObservedAtJST><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:57:10 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>ないなら、作ろうAIと。消えたFlash戦車ゲームのモダナイズと、16本の設計判断（ADR）</title><link>https://zenn.dev/tobaccotaro/articles/tanktaktix-overview</link><guid isPermaLink="false">urn:sha256:c4e8d6f266bbb17cd0a